<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:40:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>俄罗斯因炼油厂遇袭将航空燃油出口禁令延长至游行</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/russia-extends-jet-fuel-export-ban-to-march-on-refinery-attacks</link><description>由于乌克兰继续袭击该国的炼油厂，俄罗斯将大多数航空燃油出口禁令延长了四个月，直至三月份，以保持国内市场供应。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/russia-extends-jet-fuel-export-ban-to-march-on-refinery-attacks'&gt;俄罗斯因炼油厂遇袭将航空燃油出口禁令延长至游行&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russia Extends Jet Fuel Export Ban to March on Refinery Attacks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/russia-extends-jet-fuel-export-ban-to-march-on-refinery-attacks</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:54:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</link><description>随着投资者重返科技股以及人工智能行业情绪改善，亚洲新兴市场股市预计每周上涨，收复了近期的部分抛售。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing'&gt;随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Emerging Stocks Head for Biggest Weekly Gain Since June&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>JSE 寻求 Dangote 炼油厂二次上市以推动扩张</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jse-courts-dangote-refinery-secondary-listing-in-expansion-push</link><description>非洲最大的证券交易所正在与丹格特集团合作，为其位于约翰内斯堡的巨型炼油厂的潜在二次上市铺平道路，该交易所负责人表示，这一结果将是其具有里程碑意义的尼日利亚首次公开募股后的理想下一步。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jse-courts-dangote-refinery-secondary-listing-in-expansion-push'&gt;JSE 寻求 Dangote 炼油厂二次上市以推动扩张&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：JSE Courts Dangote Refinery Secondary Listing in Expansion Push&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jse-courts-dangote-refinery-secondary-listing-in-expansion-push</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:21:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</link><description>交易员权衡美联储加息的前景与美国科技股反弹推动的更广泛市场复苏，金价企稳。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week'&gt;美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Rises as Rebound in Tech Stocks Helps Revive Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:53:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</link><description>铜价与亚洲科技股一起从 11 个月低点反弹，因人工智能交易担忧引发的数周波动后，市场风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite'&gt;风险偏好回归，铜价自 11 个月低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Surges the Most in 10 Months as Risk Appetite Returns&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/copper-rebounds-from-11-month-low-on-return-of-risk-appetite</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:07 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>